    (ii)     0 ms -> sec=0 nsec=0
    (ii)     1 ms -> sec=0 nsec=1000000
    (ii)   999 ms -> sec=0 nsec=999000000
    (ii)  1000 ms -> sec=1 nsec=0
    (ii)  1500 ms -> sec=1 nsec=500000000
    (ii)  2500 ms -> sec=2 nsec=500000000
    (ii) 1500 ms wait, no signal: rc=-1 elapsed 1502.226 ms -> PASS
    (ii) clamping -> PASS
    (iii) 100 create/post-5/destroy cycles, no waiter -> PASS
    (iv) waiter blocked for 5000 ms, then a stop-style post: rc=0 in 0.016 ms -> PASS
